<title>HISVIA 资料图片归类 — 7大方向 × 品牌整机 × 配件</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:-apple-system,"PingFang SC",sans-serif;background:#f0f2f5;color:#1a1a1a;padding:20px;line-height:1.6}
h1{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:4px}
.sub{font-size:12px;color:#666;margin-bottom:16px}
.toc{background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:20px}
.toc h3{font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px}
.toc a{color:#1a6fb2;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;margin-right:16px;line-height:2}
.toc a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.toc .miss{color:#c0392b;font-size:11px}
.cat{background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:8px;padding:18px;margin-bottom:16px}
.cat-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#1a6fb2;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:2px solid #1a6fb2;margin-bottom:10px}
.cat-desc{font-size:13px;color:#555;margin-bottom:12px;padding:8px 12px;background:#f8f9fa;border-radius:4px}
.cat-apps{font-size:12px;color:#666;margin-bottom:10px}
.cat-apps b{color:#333}
.sub-h{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin:14px 0 8px;color:#333}
.brand-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px}
.brand-card{border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:6px;padding:12px;background:#fff}
.brand-card .bn{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px}
.brand-card .bc{font-size:11px;color:#888;margin-bottom:4px}
.brand-card .bt{font-size:10px;color:#1a6fb2;background:#e8f0fe;display:inline-block;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:2px;margin-bottom:6px}
.brand-card .miss{font-size:11px;color:#c0392b;background:#fdeaea;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:3px}
.parts-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px}
.part-block{border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:6px;padding:10px;background:#fff}
.part-block .pn{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px}
.part-block .pe{font-size:11px;color:#888;margin-bottom:6px}
.part-block .imgs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px}
.part-block .miss{font-size:11px;color:#c0392b;padding:6px;background:#fdeaea;border-radius:3px}
.c{border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}
.c img{width:100%;height:120px;object-fit:contain;background:#fff;display:block;cursor:zoom-in;border-bottom:1px solid #eee}
.c img.zoom{position:fixed;top:5%;left:5%;width:90%;height:auto;max-height:90vh;z-index:99}
.lb{padding:4px 6px;font-size:10px}
.lb .desc{color:#444}
.lb .fl{color:#999;font-family:monospace;font-size:9px;margin-top:2px}
.page-struct{font-size:12px;color:#555;background:#f0f4f8;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:4px;border-left:3px solid #1a6fb2;margin-top:8px}
.summary{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:16px}
.stat{background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:4px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:13px}
.stat b{font-size:18px;color:#1a6fb2}
.stat.warn b{color:#e67e22}
</style></head><body>
<h1>HISVIA 资料图片归类</h1>
<p class="sub">桌面「资料图片.docx」7大方向 × 已保留43张图片对照 · 品牌/整机/配件三维度分类</p>
<div class="summary">
<div class="stat"><b>7</b> 大方向</div>
<div class="stat"><b>43</b> 已有图片</div>
<div class="stat warn"><b>31</b> 缺图分类</div>
</div>

<div class="toc">
<h3>目录</h3>
